# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

A vault SSH keypair: a PEM-encoded private key and its matching public key line (`algorithm key comment`), stored together, encrypted at rest and versioned. The API never returns either key. Changing `public_key` or `private_key` creates a new version and makes it current.

A container mounts its SSH keypairs in `vault.ssh_keypairs`.

